      "user": "gamer-7ca6138",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Really enjoyed it until the Platform ARCAS level when I rage quit due to clunky controls. This was not far from end of game anyway. Recommended if you like linear games with no side quests and lots of gore. Do not pay full price for it though. General consesus seems to be that it is an inferior version of Dead Space."
