    {
      "game": "Dead by Daylight: Chorus of Sin",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/23751/450x258/dead-by-daylight-chorus-of-sin-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1789592400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/23751-buy-dead-by-daylight-chorus-of-sin-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-5ff4ab",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Super easy and quick to reedem on steam. As for the dlc itself I love the new killer and the survivor! The killer perks are good, the survivor ones are okay. If you like the game then grab it since I got it for a fairly cheap deal compared to the full price"
    },
    {
      "game": "Onimusha: Way of the Sword - Premium Deluxe Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/22882/450x258/onimusha-way-of-the-sword-premium-deluxe-edition-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1789592400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/22882-buy-onimusha-way-of-the-sword-premium-deluxe-edition-pc-steam/",
      "user": "JukeDuken",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "really enjoyed Onimusha overall. The boss fights were my favorite part of the game because they were exciting and challenging. The combat was also fun and made the battles feel satisfying.\n\n\n\nHowever, I didn’t enjoy the exploration as much. I found it a bit boring at times, and exploring the areas wasn’t always very interesting.\n\n\n\nOverall, Onimusha is a good game, especially because of its boss fights. I just wish the exploration had been more enjoyable and varied."
    },
    {
      "game": "The Blood of Dawnwalker",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/15628/450x258/the-blood-of-dawnwalker-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1789592400",
