      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/6014359-1608123491.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "If you loved the Witcher III gameplay, you are going nuts about this game! \n\n\n\nIt's a love letter from ex dev of said game and you can really, really tell. Gameplay is smooth, quests are well written, dialogue is meaningful and the environment is captivating and unique"
